  <section id="flow" class="step">
    <h2>🌐 Step 1: Flow Overview</h2>
    <p>This is the pipeline we’ll build:</p>
    <pre><code>TradingView (Pine Script) → n8n Webhook → Filter/Limit → Telegram Alerts → (Optional: Google Sheets Log)</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section id="pine" class="step">
    <h2>📌 Step 2: TradingView Pine Script</h2>
    <p>Add this script to NIFTY / BANKNIFTY / SENSEX / FINNIFTY intraday charts (5m).</p>
    <pre><code>// Pine Script v5 — generates CE/PE signals with SL, targets, confidence
//@version=5
indicator("Intraday CE/PE Alerts", overlay=true)
ema20 = ta.ema(close, 20)
ema50 = ta.ema(close, 50)
trendUp = ema20 > ema50
trendDown = ema20 < ema50
atr = ta.atr(14)
longCond = trendUp and ta.crossover(ema20, ema50)
shortCond = trendDown and ta.crossunder(ema20, ema50)
sl = close - atr
slShort = close + atr
t1 = close + atr * 1.5
t2 = close + atr * 2
alertcondition(longCond, title="Call Entry", message='{"symbol":"{{ticker}}","side":"CE","entry":{{close}},"sl":{{close}}-{{atr}},"t1":{{close}}+{{atr}}*1.5,"t2":{{close}}+{{atr}}*2,"confidence":70}')
alertcondition(shortCond, title="Put Entry", message='{"symbol":"{{ticker}}","side":"PE","entry":{{close}},"sl":{{close}}+{{atr}},"t1":{{close}}-{{atr}}*1.5,"t2":{{close}}-{{atr}}*2,"confidence":70}')
plot(ema20, color=color.blue)
plot(ema50, color=color.red)</code></pre>
    <div class="note">Save & add to chart → Create alert → Condition: Any alert() function call</div>
  </section>

  <section id="alerts" class="step">
    <h2>🔗 Step 3: TradingView Alert Setup</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Condition: Indicator → Any alert() function call</li>
      <li>Options: Once per bar close</li>
      <li>Webhook URL: Your n8n webhook URL</li>
      <li>Message: Leave empty (script sends JSON)</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="workflow" class="step">
    <h2>🛠 Step 4: n8n Workflow Import</h2>
    <p>Import this JSON into n8n:</p>
    <pre><code>{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "Webhook1",
      "name": "TradingView Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "Function1",
      "name": "Filter + Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "Telegram1",
      "name": "Send to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>
    <div class="note">This workflow filters signals, caps to 3 per day, calculates ATM strike, and sends to Telegram.</div>
